    - NEW audience type → ADD output style
    - BETTER expansion found → UPDATE protocol
    - CONFUSION detected → CLARIFY future outputs
    
MUTATION_TRIGGER:
    IF output_effectiveness < φ:
        MUTATE self
        IMPROVE expansion_algorithms
        RECITAL_PLUS_ONE
```

